  "answer": "### Issue Presented\n\nHowever, if you anticipate that your gross receipts will exceed the ₱3 million threshold in the next 12 months, you may need to register. Additionally, Section 236 of the NIRC mandates that any person who becomes liable to register must do so with the appropriate Revenue District Office.\n\nIn summary, based on your current gross receipts, VAT registration is not required, but you should monitor your income closely to ensure compliance if your earnings increase.\n\n### Relevant Facts / Assumptions\nThe factual circumstances have not been fully described. The analysis is based on the question as presented.\n\n### Alternative Interpretations\nNo alternative interpretations identified from the available indexed authorities.\n\n### Position Strength\nPosition strength is preliminary and subject to full fact pattern verification.",
